  "details": "How about content creation system built into the vrchat client. Which you can create world's , avatar, animations. In world. With out the need for an sdk or unity. You can import your blender creations into the main client. And edit them in world in a user sandbox. Once complete can set whether content is for public or private use. And set it for either cross platform or pc use. Even optimise the world or model in the sandbox. Even bug test before uploading it.",
